<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>:hover Pseudo-Class</title>
<style>
 body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 80px; }
 button { padding: 12px 30px; font-size: 17px; color: #fff; background: #2196f3;
 border: none; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; transition: all .3s; }
 button:hover { background: #ff5722; transform: scale(1.1); box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.4); }
 a { display: inline-block; margin-left: 30px; font-size: 18px; color: #2196f3;
 text-decoration: none; padding: 8px 14px; transition: all .3s; }
 a:hover { color: #fff; background: #4caf50; text-decoration: underline; border-radius: 6px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
 <button>Hover over me</button>
 <a href="https://www.unipune.ac.in">Visit SPPU Website</a>
</body>
</html>
